## 4. Completion Readiness Definition

### Verification Ready
```
mutation_seen = True
AND verification_passed = True
AND verified_revision == evidence_epoch
```
仅表示"当前 workspace revision 已通过验证"。

### Task Complete Eligible
```
Verification Ready
AND no pending approval
AND no pending user input
AND obligation_deficits = []
AND executed_count > 0
```
由 `rctx.completion_eligibility()` 计算。

### Guard B 触发条件
```
completion_eligibility.eligible == True
AND (tool is READ/DISCOVERY AND NOT one_shot_read_consumed)
OR (tool is VERIFICATION AND epoch <= verified_revision AND announced)
```

---

## 5. Verification Ready vs Task Complete

| 状态 | 定义 | Guard B 行为 |
|------|------|-------------|
| Verification Ready | verified_revision == epoch | 允许最后一次 read，之后阻断 |
| Task Complete Eligible | Verification Ready + no blockers | 同上 |

Guard B 消费真实 `completion_eligibility()`，不自行推导 completion rule。

